  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.20 Presiding officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.20 “Presiding officer” means the chairman of the public utilities commission, or the person designated to act on the chairman’s behalf at a hearing pursuant to Puc 204.06, or an individual conducting a hearing pursuant to RSA 363:16.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
